docs {
  # Deprecated. Manage host monitoring settings via the environment API v2 settings endpoint with schemaIds 'builtin:host.monitoring' and 'builtin:host.monitoring.mode' instead.

  **Deprecated**

  Deprecated. Manage host monitoring settings via the [Settings endpoint](index.jsp?urls.primaryName=Environment%20API%20v2#/Settings%20-%20Objects) with schemaId `builtin:host.monitoring` instead.

  Gets the monitoring configuration of OneAgent on the specified host

  **Auth:** Api-Token only (OAuth not supported by this endpoint). Uses `{{DT_API_TOKEN}}`.

  **API token scopes:** ReadConfig
}
